s are delicious. And the yogurt and fruit menu is very good. A lot of Vietnamese people come here to eat. Excellent service, quality and kindness."],["Bún mắm Bé Hà","restaurant",16.06552,108.24158,"130 Bùi Hữu Nghĩa","","","","","r","Great local place. Casual restaurant. The Bun Mam is good. The rice crackers are recommended. From afar, you can already smell the fish sauce. If you are a foreign tourist this is a good choice."],["Quán Thảo","restaurant",16.07206,108.24035,"135, Dương Trí Trạch, An Hải Bắc, Sơn Trà","06:00-10:00","","","","r","Traditional street food establishment frequented mostly by locals for breakfast, on a quiet side road. While Ms Thảo serves Mì Quảng or [Province of] Quảng style noodles, she's known for her bún bò or beef noodle soup. Some like to add…"],["Hải sản Mộc quán","restaurant",16.06398,108.24146,"26 Tô Hiến Thành","","","","","r","Seafood. Busy and crowded with locals."],["Ngoc Huong","restaurant",16.0735,108.2447,"9 Võ Nguyên Giáp St","10-22","","","","r","A typical but tasty live seafood neon emporium, with the motto \"there is no seafood that is not available\", as a glance at the nightmare fuel giant isopod tank will confirm. Fear not, they also have everything else from shrimp to…"],["Ca Fe 49","bar",16.07364,108.24148,"49 Loseby, Phước Mỹ, Sơn Trà","06:00-15:00","","","","r","Ca Fe 49 is a simple, family-run, outdoor cafe serving excellent coffee at a good price. Enjoy a \"cà phê sữa đá Đà Nẵng\" while enjoying a quiet view. The husband and wife owners are friendly. Recommend if you are out in Sơn Trà."]]}